* ''The top layer always shadows'' (operator, 2026-11-11: //"The top layer always shadows"//). The recipe stack alone decides what shows: a working record shadows canon's, nothing retracts a higher layer, and a seed's canon leg warns where canon stands fresher (`override-bases.ts`, `seed-mirrors.ts`). Landed.

